WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.805
"Last stop," the pilot said.

2
00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:34.047
"Space Patrol base!"

3
00:00:34.048 --> 00:00:41.013
Ringo grabbed his bag.

4
00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:44.227
He sneezed. "Ah-choo!"

5
00:00:44.228 --> 00:00:52.425
"Ugh. Space dust!" Ringo thought.

6
00:00:52.426 --> 00:00:56.838
Today was Ringo's first day of Space Patrol.

7
00:00:56.839 --> 00:01:01.084
"I'm finally a rookie!" Ringo said.

8
00:01:01.085 --> 00:01:03.917
He looked around the base.

9
00:01:03.918 --> 00:01:07.834
"Where's Captain Nova's office?"

10
00:01:07.835 --> 00:01:12.971
Bang! A tall rookie crashed into Ringo.

11
00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.966
"Watch it, Tiny!" she snapped.

12
00:01:15.967 --> 00:01:19.392
"Sorry," Ringo said.

13
00:01:19.393 --> 00:01:22.279
"I'm looking for Captain Nova."

14
00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:26.698
The rookie blinked. "You're a rookie too?"

15
00:01:26.699 --> 00:01:28.468
Ringo nodded.

16
00:01:28.469 --> 00:01:32.598
She laughed loudly.

17
00:01:32.599 --> 00:01:37.408
"My planet has bugs bigger than you!"

18
00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:41.893
"Bye, Tiny." The rookie ran off.

19
00:01:41.894 --> 00:01:46.632
"See you in Captain Nova's office!"

20
00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:55.535
Ringo ran after her.

21
00:01:55.536 --> 00:02:11.227
But it was hard to keep up.

22
00:02:11.228 --> 00:02:16.612
Finally they found Captain Nova's office.

23
00:02:16.613 --> 00:02:21.501
The captain seemed very busy.

24
00:02:21.502 --> 00:02:24.410
She looked at the tall rookie.

25
00:02:24.411 --> 00:02:30.021
"Welcome to Space Patrol, Lucy."

26
00:02:30.022 --> 00:02:34.916
Ringo wiped his nose.

27
00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:38.084
"Who are you?" Captain Nova asked.

28
00:02:38.085 --> 00:02:42.243
Ringo puffed out his chest. "I'm Ringo.

29
00:02:42.244 --> 00:02:44.380
I'm a rookie too."

30
00:02:44.381 --> 00:02:49.465
"What?" Captain Nova stared at Ringo.

31
00:02:49.466 --> 00:02:54.243
Then she checked her pad.

32
00:02:54.244 --> 00:02:57.307
"Lucy is the only new rookie today.

33
00:02:57.308 --> 00:03:02.456
Your name isn't here."

